      "section_id": "kohler-volume-2:p0277-p0280:s00:x00",
      "section_type": "taxonomy",
      "original_text": "                                       Jatrorhiza palmata Miers.\n Syn. Menispermum palmatum Lam.                     Menispermum Columba Roxb.                  Cocculus palmatus D.C.\n         Jatrorhiza    Columba Miers.        Jatrorhiza Miersii Oliv.           Chasmanthera         Columba Baill.\n\n           Kalumb-     oder Colombostaude,          Kolumbowurzel,        Kalumbawurzel,          Ruhrwurzel        —\n                                                Colombo —         Calumba.\n             Familie: Menispermaceae; Gattung: Jatrorhiza Miers (irrthümlich Jateorhiza).",
      "normalized_text": null,
      "zh_tw_rendering": "學名 Jatrorhiza palmata Miers，同物異名包括 Menispermum palmatum 等。隸屬於防風草科。",
      "evidence_indexes": [
        0
      ],
